/* checks if each dice has the same  value
grabs first value of dice with const firstValue
The everymethod is then used on the dice array. It tests whether all elements in 
the array pass the provided function. If every dice value `d` is equal to the first 
value `firstValue`, it means all dice have the same value, and the function 
